    {
      "source": "<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> implementation specific for executing <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Predicate</code></a> based <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a> against\n<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "针对执行基于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Predicate</code></a> 的 <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a> 的 <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> 实现，其针对的是 <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> implementation specific for executing <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> based <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a> against\n<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "针对执行基于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> 的 <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a> 而专门设计的 <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> 实现，该实现针对 <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/mapping/AnnotationBasedKeySpaceResolver.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.mapping\"><code>AnnotationBasedKeySpaceResolver</code></a> looks up <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Persistent.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>Persistent</code></a> and checks for presence of either meta or direct\nusage of <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/annotation/KeySpace.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.annotation\"><code>KeySpace</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/mapping/AnnotationBasedKeySpaceResolver.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.mapping\"><code>AnnotationBasedKeySpaceResolver</code></a> 会查找 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/annotation/Persistent.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.annotation\"><code>Persistent</code></a>，并检查是否存在对 <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/annotation/KeySpace.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.annotation\"><code>KeySpace</code></a> 的元数据使用或直接使用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/repository/query/KeyValuePartTreeQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.repository.query\"><code>KeyValuePartTreeQuery</code></a> implementation deriving queries from <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/PartTree.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a> using a predefined\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/AbstractQueryCreator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>AbstractQueryCreator</code></a> that caches the once created query.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/repository/query/KeyValuePartTreeQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.repository.query\"><code>KeyValuePartTreeQuery</code></a> 实现从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/PartTree.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a> 派生查询，使用预定义的、缓存已创建查询一次的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/AbstractQueryCreator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>AbstractQueryCreator</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Default implementation of a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> using <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/mapping/KeyValuePersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.mapping\"><code>KeyValuePersistentEntity</code></a> and\n<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/mapping/KeyValuePersistentProperty.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.mapping\"><code>KeyValuePersistentProperty</code></a> as primary abstractions.",
      "translation": "使用 <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/mapping/KeyValuePersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.mapping\"><code>KeyValuePersistentEntity</code></a> 和\n<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/mapping/KeyValuePersistentProperty.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.mapping\"><code>KeyValuePersistentProperty</code></a> 作为主要抽象的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> 的默认实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/RepositoryQuery.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>RepositoryQuery</code></a> implementation deriving queries from <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/PartTree.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a> using a predefined\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/AbstractQueryCreator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>AbstractQueryCreator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/RepositoryQuery.html\" title=\"类或接口，位于 org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>RepositoryQuery</code></a> 实现通过预定义的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/AbstractQueryCreator.html\" title=\"类或接口，位于 org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>AbstractQueryCreator</code></a> 从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/PartTree.html\" title=\"类或接口，位于 org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a> 派生查询。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Factory class for obtaining <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/AbstractQueryCreator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>AbstractQueryCreator</code></a> instances for a given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/PartTree.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a> and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/ParameterAccessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>ParameterAccessor</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于为给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/PartTree.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>PartTree</code></a> 和\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/ParameterAccessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>ParameterAccessor</code></a> 获取 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/AbstractQueryCreator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>AbstractQueryCreator</code></a> 实例的工厂类。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/AbstractQueryCreator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>AbstractQueryCreator</code></a> to create <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Predicate</code></a>-based <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "使用<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/AbstractQueryCreator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>AbstractQueryCreator</code></a>来创建基于<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>Predicate</code></a>的<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> object from given <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a> and potentially converts it into a store specific\nrepresentation that can be used by the <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> implementation.",
      "translation": "从给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.data.domain 中的\"><code>Sort</code></a>对象解析出排序信息，并可能将其转换为特定存储实现可使用的<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query 中的\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a>的特定表示形式。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/SpelCriteria.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>SpelCriteria</code></a> allows to pass on a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> to the actual query\nprocessor.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/SpelCriteria.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core 中的类\"><code>SpelCriteria</code></a> 允许将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.expression.spel.standard 中的类或接口\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.expression 中的类或接口\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> 传递给实际的查询处理器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/AbstractQueryCreator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>AbstractQueryCreator</code></a> to create <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a>-based <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "使用<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/parser/AbstractQueryCreator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query.parser\"><code>AbstractQueryCreator</code></a>来创建基于<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a>的<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/query/KeyValueQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.query\"><code>KeyValueQuery</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Base implementation of <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a> holds <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a> to delegate find and\ncount execution to.",
      "translation": "基础实现类实现了<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a>接口，并持有用于委派查找和计数执行的<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/QueryEngine.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>QueryEngine</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Most trivial implementation of <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/mapping/KeySpaceResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.mapping\"><code>KeySpaceResolver</code></a> returning the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html#getName()\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class.getName()</code></a>.",
