      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a> implementation for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.util 中\"><code>Map</code></a>的<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/KeyValueAdapter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core 中的接口\"><code>KeyValueAdapter</code></a>实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/mapping/KeySpaceResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.mapping\"><code>KeySpaceResolver</code></a> prefixing the keyspace with a static prefix after determining the keyspace from a\ndelegate <a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/mapping/KeySpaceResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.mapping\"><code>KeySpaceResolver</code></a>.",
      "translation": "在从委托<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/mapping/KeySpaceResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.mapping\"><code>KeySpaceResolver</code></a>确定键空间后，<a href=\"org/springframework/data/keyvalue/core/mapping/KeySpaceResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core.mapping\"><code>KeySpaceResolver</code></a> 会在键空间前添加一个静态前缀。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Comparator.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Comparator</code></a> implementation to compare objects based on a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/core/PropertyPath.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>PropertyPath</code></a>.",
